{"2864290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aggelos 2", "steam_appid": 2864290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggelos 2 is an explosive action-platformer where lightning-fast combat, precision platforming, and two opposing worlds collide. As an Aggelos, the highest order of angels, you are chosen by Balro to venture through the Kingdom of Lumen, domain of the supreme God of Light. But with Lumen under siege and the Gods facing imminent defeat at the hands of the Army of Darkness, you are forced to embrace a shadowy new form to survive the chaos of both light and dark realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your angelic side favors a slower, disciplined approach, your demon form is highly agile, aggressive, and bristling with dark powers. Mastering the shift between both forms is key to survival, and only by balancing order and chaos can you hope to overcome formidable enemies, deadly obstacles, and challenging puzzles along your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/23d81dcd1a31ef98f264aefa0125d724.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/23d81dcd1a31ef98f264aefa0125d724.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore two massive, overlapping maps, each with their own unique characteristics, enemies to fight, secrets to discover, and challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/3236dee2c88826b0c5933a58b19b94e4.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/3236dee2c88826b0c5933a58b19b94e4.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Angel and Demon forms to change the world and your playstyle, from precise defenses to fast assaults, mastering timing, strategy, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/6425b9581be96f52244949fade16558d.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/6425b9581be96f52244949fade16558d.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on hordes of enemies and conquer 13 massive bosses across both realms. Steel yourself for memorable encounters that build on the original game’s signature battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/b19c0968bf0048d805c56ecd97f54cef.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/b19c0968bf0048d805c56ecd97f54cef.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenges by mastering skills, memorising routes, manipulating mechanisms, avoiding traps, and interacting with the world to reveal secrets and new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/1127533b0f706bec826fedd3895136cc.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/1127533b0f706bec826fedd3895136cc.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect orbs to unlock devastating special attacks, boost your strength and increase your survivability, adding a tactical layer to your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/86bf285a72e763df2f8ff1ce73554c87.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/86bf285a72e763df2f8ff1ce73554c87.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new skills as you progress, from flight and wall grabs to dashes and powerful special attacks, offering up new ways to explore and reach previously inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/947e5e0b15c99e0bfcf30b29de0045d7.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/947e5e0b15c99e0bfcf30b29de0045d7.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking pixel art and detailed sprites designed to complement smooth, fast-paced 2D gameplay.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggelos 2 is an explosive action-platformer where lightning-fast combat, precision platforming, and two opposing worlds collide. As an Aggelos, the highest order of angels, you are chosen by Balro to venture through the Kingdom of Lumen, domain of the supreme God of Light. But with Lumen under siege and the Gods facing imminent defeat at the hands of the Army of Darkness, you are forced to embrace a shadowy new form to survive the chaos of both light and dark realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your angelic side favors a slower, disciplined approach, your demon form is highly agile, aggressive, and bristling with dark powers. Mastering the shift between both forms is key to survival, and only by balancing order and chaos can you hope to overcome formidable enemies, deadly obstacles, and challenging puzzles along your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/23d81dcd1a31ef98f264aefa0125d724.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/23d81dcd1a31ef98f264aefa0125d724.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore two massive, overlapping maps, each with their own unique characteristics, enemies to fight, secrets to discover, and challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/3236dee2c88826b0c5933a58b19b94e4.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/3236dee2c88826b0c5933a58b19b94e4.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Angel and Demon forms to change the world and your playstyle, from precise defenses to fast assaults, mastering timing, strategy, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/6425b9581be96f52244949fade16558d.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/6425b9581be96f52244949fade16558d.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on hordes of enemies and conquer 13 massive bosses across both realms. Steel yourself for memorable encounters that build on the original game’s signature battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/b19c0968bf0048d805c56ecd97f54cef.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/b19c0968bf0048d805c56ecd97f54cef.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenges by mastering skills, memorising routes, manipulating mechanisms, avoiding traps, and interacting with the world to reveal secrets and new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/1127533b0f706bec826fedd3895136cc.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/1127533b0f706bec826fedd3895136cc.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect orbs to unlock devastating special attacks, boost your strength and increase your survivability, adding a tactical layer to your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/86bf285a72e763df2f8ff1ce73554c87.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/86bf285a72e763df2f8ff1ce73554c87.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new skills as you progress, from flight and wall grabs to dashes and powerful special attacks, offering up new ways to explore and reach previously inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras/947e5e0b15c99e0bfcf30b29de0045d7.avif?t=1787844998\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/extras_big/947e5e0b15c99e0bfcf30b29de0045d7.webp?t=1787844998 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking pixel art and detailed sprites designed to complement smooth, fast-paced 2D gameplay.</p>", "short_description": "With the Gods of light about to lose the great battle against the Army of Darkness, the Aggelos must learn to embrace his darker side. Explore two opposing realms full of secrets, puzzles and intense 2D combat in this challenging action-platformer.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/441836ea8aa446b4d9c8f56e7e45fee67b0e8952/header.jpg?t=1787844998", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/c1c212df9ad0b052df0f92a46e53b24787df5f25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787844998", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864290/c1c212df9ad0b052df0f92a46e53b24787df5f25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787844998", "website": "https://pqube.co.uk/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 200 Mhz Pentium processor or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Must support DirectX 11 or Vulkan<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or Equivalent <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 1030 or AMD Radeon RX 550 or Intel UHD Graphics 770<br>